# SECURITY, second layer only. Since 2026-10-25 Netlify publishes _site/, built
# by netlify/build-site.cjs, so these paths are not deployed at all. The rules
# below are NOT enough on their own: Netlify serves file paths
# case-insensitively but matches these rules case-sensitively, so before the
# build filter /Netlify/functions/... and /Tools/... still returned the files.
# Functions run at /.netlify/functions/<name> (leading dot), unaffected.
/netlify/*        /index.html   404!
/tools/*          /index.html   404!
/blog-data/*      /index.html   404!
/package.json     /index.html   404!
/package-lock.json /index.html  404!
